<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="29009655"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1440628787"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="East of Eden"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Zella Day"/><amll:meta key="album" value="East of Eden"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:06.213"><div begin="00:00.400" end="02:58.305"><p begin="00:00.400" end="00:04.155" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Pink toes pressed against the carpet<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉嫩脚趾踩在地毯上</span></p><p begin="00:04.255" end="00:07.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Show your face and finish what you started<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现身吧 继续你未完成的使命</span></p><p begin="00:07.999" end="00:11.835" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">The record spins down the alley, late night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">音乐回荡在深夜宁静的弄巷中</span></p><p begin="00:12.035" end="00:15.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Be my friend, surround me like a satellite<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">做我的朋友吧 像卫星般环绕我身边</span></p><p begin="00:15.458" end="00:17.381" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Tiger on the prowl<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">野兽潜伏在</span></p><p begin="00:17.881" end="00:19.425" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">East of Eden<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伊甸之东 蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="00:19.435" end="00:22.293" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Comin' for you now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就要向你袭来</span></p><p begin="00:22.303" end="00:26.362" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Keep me from the cages under the control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我逃离囚禁的牢笼</span></p><p begin="00:26.372" end="00:30.154" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Runnin' in the dark to find east of Eden<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔向无尽的黑夜 找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="00:30.164" end="00:34.051" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Keep me from the cages under the control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我逃离囚禁的牢笼</span></p><p begin="00:34.061" end="00:37.754" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Runnin' in the dark to find east of Eden<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔向无尽的黑夜 找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="00:37.764" end="00:41.537" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="00:41.547" end="00:45.471" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="00:45.481" end="00:49.358" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="00:49.368" end="00:53.647" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="00:54.926" end="00:58.784" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Call me wild, drinkin' up the sunshine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唤我狂野 痛饮阳光</span></p><p begin="00:58.844" end="01:02.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Be my man and show me what it feels like<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">做我的男人吧 向我述说这甜蜜体验</span></p><p begin="01:02.722" end="01:06.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Denim sky, unbuttoned down the middle<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">丹宁牛仔上的纽扣一粒粒解开</span></p><p begin="01:06.620" end="01:10.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Spillin' out little by little<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一点一点向我吐露真心</span></p><p begin="01:10.141" end="01:12.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Tiger on the prowl<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">野兽潜伏在</span></p><p begin="01:12.535" end="01:14.038" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">East of Eden<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伊甸之东 蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="01:14.048" end="01:16.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Comin' for you now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就要向你袭来</span></p><p begin="01:16.883" end="01:20.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Keep me from the cages under the control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我逃离囚禁的牢笼</span></p><p begin="01:20.950" end="01:24.771" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Runnin' in the dark to find east of Eden<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔向无尽的黑夜 找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="01:24.771" end="01:28.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Keep me from the cages under the control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我逃离囚禁的牢笼</span></p><p begin="01:28.760" end="01:32.457" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Runnin' in the dark to find east of Eden<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔向无尽的黑夜 找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="01:32.467" end="01:36.138" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="01:36.238" end="01:39.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="01:40.065" end="01:43.992" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="01:44.002" end="01:47.918" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="01:49.528" end="01:52.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">If I wanted to stay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我想留下</span></p><p begin="01:52.167" end="01:56.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">You don't mind, you're a true believer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不会在意 只因你是爱情忠实的信徒</span></p><p begin="01:56.014" end="01:59.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">True believer</p><p begin="01:57.539" end="01:59.926" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Take it up with the badlands<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逐渐习惯了这一切</span></p><p begin="01:59.936" end="02:03.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Creep on in like a concrete fever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这感觉就像发烧一般慢慢侵蚀身心</span></p><p begin="02:05.181" end="02:07.771" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">If I wanted to stay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我想留下</span></p><p begin="02:07.781" end="02:12.123" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">You don't mind, you're a true believer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不会在意 只因你是爱情忠实的信徒</span></p><p begin="02:11.723" end="02:15.107" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">True believer</p><p begin="02:13.043" end="02:15.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Take it up with the badlands<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逐渐习惯了这一切</span></p><p begin="02:15.549" end="02:19.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Creep on in like a concrete fever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这感觉就像发烧一般慢慢侵蚀身心</span></p><p begin="02:27.182" end="02:31.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Keep me from the cages under the control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我逃离囚禁的牢笼</span></p><p begin="02:31.250" end="02:35.032" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Runnin' in the dark to find east of Eden<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔向无尽的黑夜 找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="02:35.042" end="02:39.026" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Keep me from the cages under the control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我逃离囚禁的牢笼</span></p><p begin="02:39.036" end="02:42.708" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Runnin' in the dark to find east of Eden<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔向无尽的黑夜 找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="02:42.708" end="02:46.491" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="02:46.501" end="02:50.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="02:50.310" end="02:54.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p><p begin="02:54.276" end="02:58.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">To find east of Eden (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻伊甸之东</span></p></div></body></tt>